# fresh_dev_suspend_finish_then_stop: rvg_device_finish_suspend, then stop: the root and the display page are torn down with the guest display still paused by rvg_device_finish_suspend, and nothing dies. The run state stays 2, so when the guest brings the root FIFO up again its NOP completes and the stamp lands (0x1018), but no interrupt is raised (an interrupt is raised only in state 0).
